OL,3,GNEWSALifetime achievement award for
OL,4,Acycling instructor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who helped more than 15,000
OL,7,Fcyclists to safely navigate the roads
OL,8,Fhas been honoured with a lifetime
OL,9,Fachievement award.
OL,11,FJulie Turner, 67, from Driffield, has
OL,12,Fworked as a road safety instructor at
OL,13,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council for 25
OL,14,Fyears, and as a volunteer for three
OL,15,Fyears before that.
OL,17,FThe honour has been awarded by the
OL,18,FBikeability Trust - the Department for
OL,19,FTransport's national cycle training
OL,20,Fprogramme for school children in
OL,21,FEngland.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
